# Implementing features

Start from `docs/map.md`, then `docs/patterns.md` and `docs/testing.md`. Do not grep the whole repo to learn a subsystem.

Follow the project guides — do not invent a parallel stack:

- Admin list pages: `.cursor/rules/admin-grid.mdc` + `docs/add-admin-section.md` §6 (`Admin/Grid/Definitions/*Grid`, `grid.twig`, mass **or** row actions — never both)
- Admin ACL: `.cursor/rules/acl.mdc` + `docs/acl.md` (`AdminResourceCatalog`, `requireAdminResource` on POSTs)
- Pages: `docs/add-page.md` (route → controller → layout JSON → Twig → i18n)
- Repositories: `docs/add-repository.md` (PDO prepared, `reveal()`, DI in `Application`)
- Themes: `docs/add-theme.md` (parent theme, override by path and node `id`)
- Locales: `docs/add-locale.md` (keys in `en.json`)
- Payments / economy / SEO / inbox: `docs/payments.md`, `docs/economy.md`, `docs/seo.md`, `docs/notifications.md`
- Security: `.cursor/rules/security.mdc` + `docs/security.md` (contracts in `tests/Unit/Contract/SecurityContractTest.php`)
- After a behavior change: update `docs/map.md` and the linked doc; add/adjust a unit test (`docs/testing.md`)

## Must not skip

- Register routes in `src/Http/PublicRoutes.php` or `src/Http/AdminRoutes.php`; wire controllers in `src/Http/controller_factories.php`
- Admin controllers live in `src/Http/Controller/Admin/`; public controllers in `src/Http/Controller/`
- New repositories go in `src/Repository/`; application services in `src/Service/`
- POST handlers call `assertCsrf()` (or `runMassActions()`)
- Admin mutating POSTs call `audit()` / `auditChange()` / `runMassActions()`
- Sensitive auth POSTs stay behind `RateLimiter`
- Auth-only pages call `requireAuth()`
- Admin mutations call `requireAdminResource()` / `runMassActions()` / `requireAdminSection()`; add the id to `AdminResourceCatalog`
- Add translation keys to `lang/en.json`
- Keep `tests/Unit/Contract/SecurityContractTest.php` green; new behavior gets a `tests/Unit/` test
- Do not reformat or rewrite unrelated files
